spans.s:
YUP (V., rare, only pf., pp., and cs.), 🞄debar, obstruct;
 efface, remove;
 thwart;
 🞄violate (laws);
 be effaced or invisible: pp. 🞄yupitá;
 cs. yopáyati, efface (mark);
 intv. 🞄yoyupyáte, smooth. ā, cs. transgress. sam, 🞄cs. efface, remove.

yū́p-a, m. post, beam, pillar;
 sp. sacrificial 🞄post: -tva, n. condition of a post;
 -vat, 🞄a. connected with the sacrificial post (rite);
 🞄-vāhá, a. bringing the sacrificial post;
 -vraská, a. hewing the sacrificial post.
